  "prefLabel": "Plc 1801.03 Notifications; Issuance of Certifications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1801.03 Notifications; Issuance of Certifications. The office of professional licensure and certification (OPLC) shall send all notifications to applicants and certificants, and all certifications issued pursuant to this chapter, in accordance with Plc 301.03.\n\nSource. #14330, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
